# Credential scratch files. These live in the repo root during setup and are
# NOT ignored by the .env* rules above, so a routine `git add -A` would commit
# them straight to a public remote. razorpay_testkey.txt was sitting untracked
# and unignored when this was added.
*key*.txt
*secret*.txt
*credentials*.txt
